### **Creature LOD Plan (Cross-Platform)**

| LOD Level | Distance | PC | Mobile |
|-----------|----------|-----|--------|
| **Near** | 0–80 studs | Full mesh, all particles, Rthro anim | Full mesh, all particles, Rthro anim |
| **Mid** | 80–160 studs | Full mesh, reduced particle rate (×0.5), Rthro anim | Simplified mesh (LOD1), particles ×0.5, Rthro anim |
| **Far** | 160–300 studs | LOD mesh (LOD1), minimal particles, Rthro anim | **Mesh culled** (invisible), only billboard icon |
| **Culled** | >300 studs | LOD mesh (LOD2), no particles | N/A (already culled at 200) |

### **Mutation Particles Budget**
| Mutation | PC (max 200) | Mobile (max 50) |
|----------|--------------|-----------------|
| Golden | 8 emitters | 2 emitters (rate ×0.25) |
| Night (Glow) | 6 emitters + PointLight | 2 emitters, no PointLight |
| Storm | 5 emitters + Beam arcs | 2 emitters, no arcs |
| Rainbow | 3 emitters + HueCycle | 1 emitter, no HueCycle |

### **Hero Titan (Golden Titan Mountable)**
| Effect | PC | Mobile |
|--------|-----|--------|
| PointLight (Glow) | Range 12, Brightness 1 | **Disabled** |
| ParticleEmitter (HeroTrail) | Rate 8 | Rate 2 |
| Core/Halo Beams | Full | **Disabled** |
| Scale 1.5 | Yes | Yes (mesh only) |

